# Wave W17-K (Lastlight Pass): pass floor — Conference-road stone-sand, light and worn pale by thirty years of finalists’ boots, flat grey stone slabs showing through the sand (design-authorised pale sand running end to end, Cragmoor to Lastlight). The Pass’s own road — split from the Crown Road’s dark violet-charcoal crownfloor by value (light, not dark) and register (worn stone-sand, not laid ceremonial flags).
